caption: Test floor

\whitespace trim
\procedure ledger() lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/state/test-floor
\procedure rows(view)
<$list filter="[<ledger>floor-queue<view>]" emptyMessage="<em>none</em>">
<div class="lar-floor-row"><code><$text text=<<currentTiddler>>/></code></div>
</$list>
\end

<p>One heavy run at a time on this box; only the familiar holds the floor (operator, 2026-11-25). Tasked spirits hand back a floor ticket; the familiar runs it through <code>node tools/floor-run.mjs --ticket &lt;id&gt; -- &lt;command&gt;</code>. The ledger: <$link to=<<ledger>>><$text text=<<ledger>>/></$link>.</p>

<h3>On the floor</h3>
<<rows view:"taken">>

<h3>Lanes (service order; waiting/taken)</h3>
<<rows view:"lane">>

<h3>Waiting (served by lane, arrival within a lane)</h3>
<$list filter="[<ledger>floor-queue[waiting]]" variable="ticket" emptyMessage="<em>the queue stands empty</em>">
<pre><$text text={{{ [<ledger>floor-queue[ticket],<ticket>] }}}/></pre>
</$list>

<h3>Covered by a green sha (drop unrun)</h3>
<<rows view:"skip">>

<h3>Verdicts and bytes</h3>
<<rows view:"budget">>

<h3>Misses (a green a later red contradicts)</h3>
<<rows view:"miss">>

<h3>Runs per landing (runs/floor turns)</h3>
<<rows view:"runs-per-landing">>

<h3>Dropped</h3>
<<rows view:"dropped">>
